{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-27","kind":"proposition","title":"等圆之角所乘圆分等则其角或在心或在界俱等","englishTitle":"In equal circles angles standing on equal circumferences are equal to one another, whether they stand at the centres or at the circumferences.","book":3,"number":27,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.27","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.27/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":27,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-27@raw-d2752738ef60bc86","contentId":"euclid-3-27","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d2752738ef60bc86f244bb85f11fe9a683694407f02c94196fc5a9a3a4b4b00d","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-27.statement","euclid-3-27.proof.1","euclid-3-27.proof.2","euclid-3-27.proof.3","euclid-3-27.proof.4","euclid-3-27.proof.5","euclid-3-27.proof.6","euclid-3-27.conclusion","euclid-3-27.historical.1","euclid-3-27.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-27.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-27","revisionId":"euclid-3-27@raw-d2752738ef60bc86","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f1b4873fb26e4005a74f461b321d0e1f01833bc415279794531d7468b35adbc1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In equal circles angles standing on equal circumferences are equal to one another, whether they stand at the centres or at the circumferences."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在平等圈子中,站在平等圈子上的角度是平等的,无论在中心还是环圈。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"等圜之角所乘圜分等则其角或在心或在界俱等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果角与等圆的弧相乘为相等，则角可以在圆心或边界等处。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-27.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-27","revisionId":"euclid-3-27@raw-d2752738ef60bc86","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"839f8b141c9140eb42387627d085981032f1255c378ebdc5927cd8aa090b2f09","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For in equal circles ABC, DEF, on equal circumferences BC, EF, let the angles BGC, EHF stand at the centres G, H, and the angles BAC, EDF at the circumferences; I say that the angle BGC is equal to the angle EHF, and the angle BAC is equal to the angle EDF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"以ABC,DEF为界,以同等环绕为界,BC,EF,BGC,EHF在中心站立,G,H,BAC,EDF在环绕为界;我说,BGC为界等于EHF,BAC为界,BAC为界等于EDF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-27.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-27","revisionId":"euclid-3-27@raw-d2752738ef60bc86","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"363a71d474b2e6ef8ad7e83129cd2be191bcac1a057bbc8545280da2d77dcf4c","citations":["euclid-1-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if the angle BGC is unequal to the angle EHF, one of them is greater. Let the angle BGC be greater : and on the straight line BG, and at the point G on it, let the angle BGK be constructed equal to the angle EHF. [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果角度BGC与角度EHF不相等, 其中之一更大。 让角度BGC更大一点 : 在直线BG上, 并在G点上, 使角度BGK 等于角度EHF 。 [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-27.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-27","revisionId":"euclid-3-27@raw-d2752738ef60bc86","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ec07a5ac7f61f020157d25d1d26d50501475ee81a3b778bb932f594183a37bfc","citations":["euclid-3-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now equal angles stand on equal circumferences, when they are at the centres; [[III. 26](/principles/euclid-3-26)] therefore the circumference BK is equal to the circumference EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,在中心时,在相同的环形上,角是相等的;因此,环形BK等于环形EF。 [[III. 26](/principles/euclid-3-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-27.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-3-27","revisionId":"euclid-3-27@raw-d2752738ef60bc86","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8341a38f08c39ee885661e8f85275dd05986d271f0e1350b6c0dd933b400ecb6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But EF is equal to BC; therefore BK is also equal to BC, the less to the greater : which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EF等于BC,BK也等于BC,数量小于数量大为不可能。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-27.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-3-27","revisionId":"euclid-3-27@raw-d2752738ef60bc86","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"563fa86967b2c808c14a99fc66123358357c3373f7589cdb264d43d4f688bf48","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the angle BGC is not unequal to the angle EHF; therefore it is equal to it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BGC角度与EHF角度不相等;因此,它等于EHF角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-27.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-3-27","revisionId":"euclid-3-27@raw-d2752738ef60bc86","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5e0641b13df559ccff86aaa38624ff3b5db3d2d963cf3a8099840aa89e0d3346","citations":["euclid-3-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the angle at A is half of the angle BGC, and the angle at D half of the angle EHF; [[III. 20](/principles/euclid-3-20)] therefore the angle at A is also equal to the angle at D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A角是BGC角的一半,EHF角是D角的一半;因此,A角也等于D角。 [[III. 20](/principles/euclid-3-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-27.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-27","revisionId":"euclid-3-27@raw-d2752738ef60bc86","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-27.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-27","revisionId":"euclid-3-27@raw-d2752738ef60bc86","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"de1f2ab6f29d2cb975cdf060ce242dd0fb2a986d803c992279f9fe6ee1dd7c5e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"等圜之角所乘圜分等则其角或在心或在界俱等先解在心者曰甲乙丙丁戊己两圜等其心为庚为辛若甲庚丙乘圜角所乘之甲丙分与丁辛己所乘之丁己分等题言甲庚丙丁辛己两角等论曰如云不然而庚大于辛令作甲庚壬角与丁辛己角等即甲壬圜分宜与丁己圜分等〈本篇〉〈廿六〉而甲丙与丁己元等则甲壬与甲丙亦等乎后解在界者曰甲丙丁己两圜分等题言其上乙戊两角亦等论曰如云不然而乙大于戊令作甲乙壬角与戊角等其甲乙壬与丁戊己若等即所乘之甲壬丁己宜等〈本篇廿六〉而甲丙与丁己元等则甲壬与甲丙亦等乎増题从此推显两直线不相交而在一圜之内若两线界相去之圜分等则两线必平行若两线平行则两线界相去之圜分等先解曰甲乙丙丁圜内有甲丁乙丙两线其相去之甲乙丁丙两圜分等题言两线必平行论曰试自甲至丙作直线相联其甲乙丁丙既等即甲丙乙与丙甲丁两乘圜角亦等〈本题〉既内相对之两角等即两线必平行〈一卷廿七〉后解曰甲丁乙丙为平行线题言甲乙丁丙两圜分必等论曰试作甲丙线其甲丁乙丙既平行即内相对之两角甲丙乙丙甲丁必等〈一卷廿七〉而所乘圜分甲乙丁丙亦等〈本篇廿六〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果等圆的角度与弧相乘，则该角可以位于圆心或边界上，而在圆心的第一个解称为甲乙丙丁戊己。如果中心是庚和辛，则如果甲庚丙与圆角相乘，再乘以甲丙，并且丁辛己与丁己相乘，则甲庚丙丁辛己的两个角相等的命题解释如下：证明如下：如果这不成立，则庚大于辛。设甲庚壬和丁辛己为相等的角，即甲壬的弧应等于丁己的弧，〈本篇〉〈廿六〉和甲丙与丁己相等，则甲壬和甲丙也相等。边界上的后续解为甲丙丁己，两个弧等。命题解释：乙戊上的两个角也相等。证明如下：如果不是这样，则乙大于戊。设甲乙壬和戊的角相等。如果甲乙壬和丁戊己相等，则乘后的甲壬丁己应等于〈本篇廿六〉。如果甲丙和丁己相等，则甲壬和甲丙也相等。由此可以推断，两条直线不相交，但在一个圆内。如果两条直线之间边界上的弧相等，则两条直线必须平行。如果两条直线平行，则由边界分隔的弧如下：甲乙丙丁包含两条直线甲丁乙丙，它们之间的距离为甲乙丁丙，相等。命题解释：这两条直线必须平行。证明如下：画直线连接甲到丙。由于甲乙丁丙相等，即甲丙乙和丙甲丁乘以圆角也相等。〈本题〉 由于两个内部对角相等，这两条直线必须平行。〈一卷廿七〉解释如下：甲丁乙丙是一条平行线。甲乙丁丙的命题：这两个弧必须相等。证明如下：画直线甲丙，由于甲丁乙丙平行，两条对角甲丙乙丙甲丁必须相等〈一卷廿七〉，乘后的弧甲乙丁丙也相等。〈本篇廿六〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-27.source","contentId":"euclid-3-27","revisionId":"euclid-3-27@raw-d2752738ef60bc86","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"799bdcd200f8d2297cd9135c465fafe42466409a25094951a350cafd4de550aa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.27/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.27\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-27:euclid-1-23:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-27","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-27.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-23","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.27","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.27/","sourceLabel":"I. 23"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-27:euclid-3-26:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-27","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-27.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-26","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.27","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.27/","sourceLabel":"III. 26"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-27:euclid-3-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-27","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-27.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.27","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.27/","sourceLabel":"III. 20"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-29:euclid-3-27:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-29","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-29.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-27","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.29","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.29/","sourceLabel":"III. 27"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-11:euclid-3-27:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-11.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-27","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11/","sourceLabel":"III. 27"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-12:euclid-3-27:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-12","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-12.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-27","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.12","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.12/","sourceLabel":"III. 27"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-15:euclid-3-27:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-15.proof.13"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-27","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"III. 27"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-33:euclid-3-27:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-33","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-33.proof.1","euclid-6-33.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-27","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.33","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.33/","sourceLabel":"III. 27"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-1:euclid-3-27:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-1","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-1.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-27","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.1","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.1/","sourceLabel":"III. 27"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-17:euclid-3-27:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-17","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-17.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-27","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.17","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.17/","sourceLabel":"III. 27"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-27:euclid-1-23:explicit","id":"euclid-1-23","book":1,"number":23,"kind":"proposition","title":"在给定点复制一个角","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-27:euclid-3-26:explicit","id":"euclid-3-26","book":3,"number":26,"kind":"proposition","title":"等圆之乘圆分角或在心或在界等其所乘之圆分亦等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-27:euclid-3-20:explicit","id":"euclid-3-20","book":3,"number":20,"kind":"proposition","title":"圆心角等于同弧圆周角的两倍","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-29:euclid-3-27:explicit","id":"euclid-3-29","book":3,"number":29,"kind":"proposition","title":"等圆之圆分等则其割圆分之直线亦等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-11:euclid-3-27:explicit","id":"euclid-4-11","book":4,"number":11,"kind":"proposition","title":"圆内接正五边形的尺规作图","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-12:euclid-3-27:explicit","id":"euclid-4-12","book":4,"number":12,"kind":"proposition","title":"有圆求作圆外五边切形其形等边等角","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-15:euclid-3-27:explicit","id":"euclid-4-15","book":4,"number":15,"kind":"proposition","title":"圆内接正六边形的尺规作图","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-6-33:euclid-3-27:explicit","id":"euclid-6-33","book":6,"number":33,"kind":"proposition","title":"等圆之乘圆分角或在心或在界其各相当两乘圆角之比例皆若所乘两圆分之比例而两分…","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-12-1:euclid-3-27:explicit","id":"euclid-12-1","book":12,"number":1,"kind":"proposition","title":"圆内接相似多边形面积比等于直径平方比","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-12-17:euclid-3-27:explicit","id":"euclid-12-17","book":12,"number":17,"kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：球与切线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-circle","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be pres